        </p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#projects">See projects</a>
            <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#contact">Get in touch</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="about" class="section">
    <div class="container">
        <h2><span class="section-marker accent-red"></span>About</h2>
        <p class="section-body">
            Placeholder. A short paragraph on who you are, what you work with, and what
            you are looking for — three or four sentences is plenty.
        </p>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="projects" class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container">
        <h2><span class="section-marker accent-green"></span>Projects</h2>
        <p class="section-body">
            Placeholder. Each project becomes a card here, linking to its own page for
